*VERSION: 3.0
*WRITTEN_BY: openair-conformance
* Tests: AA SS/SR and AA EECT/BCMT on the first nights after the midnight sun. At 69.6 degrees north (Tromso) the sun sets on 25 July 2026 at about 22:38Z and rises again at about 23:04Z. At 60.75 degrees north civil twilight ends on 28 June 2026 at about 23:56Z and begins again at about 00:10Z. AA SS/SR means from sunset to sunrise of the next day, so both windows are active for a short time.

AC D
AY TRA
AN Example TRA 1
AA SS/SR 2026-07-25/2026-07-25
AH 4500 FT AMSL
AL GND
DP 69:42:00N 018:50:00E
DP 69:42:00N 019:05:00E
DP 69:36:00N 019:05:00E
DP 69:36:00N 018:50:00E
DP 69:42:00N 018:50:00E

AC D
AY TRA
AN Example TRA 2
AA EECT/BCMT 2026-06-28/2026-06-28
AH 4500 FT AMSL
AL GND
DP 60:50:00N 000:05:00W
DP 60:50:00N 000:05:00E
DP 60:40:00N 000:05:00E
DP 60:40:00N 000:05:00W
DP 60:50:00N 000:05:00W
